## Anti-Patterns to Prevent

❌ **Overly Long Prompts**: Keep prompts concise, don't include unnecessary context
❌ **No Token Counting**: Always validate token count before sending
❌ **Hardcoded Prompts**: Use templates and variables, never hardcode
❌ **Unstructured Responses**: Always request JSON with schema
❌ **No Versioning**: Track prompt versions for A/B testing and rollback
❌ **Ignoring Token Budget**: Prompt + expected response must fit in 4096 tokens

## Success Metrics

- All prompts fit within 4096 token limit
- Average prompt length < 2000 tokens
- Response parsing success rate > 90%
- Prompt rendering time < 1ms
- Clear, maintainable template structure
